                                <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                                    <span>📦</span> My Orders
                                </span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-bold bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-emerald-500/25">Track</span>
